Pidar ki yaad me roti thi fatima zehra<br>
Muh apna ashkou se dhoti thi fatima zehra <br>
Na ek aan bhi soti thi fatima zehra<br>
Alam se jaan ko khoti thi fatima zehra<br>
<br>
Na chaah pani ki aur na gharaz thi khaane se<br>
Tha kaam aankhou se qoon e jigar bahane se<br>
____________________________<br>
Tha ek to baap ka gham aur ye huwi aafat<br>
Ke batne paak me mohsin ki hogayi rehlat<br>
Bas aur ho gayi mehboos ranj o gham hazrat<br>
Na ek aan bhi mouqoof hoti thi riqqat<br>
<br>
Ye nouha tha na ziyada rulaaiye baba<br>
Jaha'n hai aap mujhe bhi bulaaiye baba<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye baat sun ke asadullah ko malaal hua<br>
Jhukaaye sar ko makaa'n me gaye jo shere quda<br>
To dekha roti hai muh dhaanpe fatima zehra<br>
Qareeb baith gaye aap bhi ba dardo buka<br>
<br>
Qalaq e kamaal huwa yaad aagaye ahmed<br>
Bada malaal huwa yaad aagaye ahmed<br>
____________________________<br>
Huwi jo der to boli ye qud wo aashiq e rab<br>
Kaho batool se jo kuch ho aap ka matlab<br>
Bahake ashk ye kehne lage ameer e arab<br>
Shikaayat aap ke rone ki karne aaye hai sab<br>
<br>
Alam me baap ke jaa'n ko na khoiyo zehra<br>
Hai shaaki ehle mohalla na roiyo zehra<br>
____________________________<br>
Meri taraf se ye un sab se ya ali kehdo<br>
Qasoor hogaya aye saahibo ma'aaf karo<br>
Yaha na roungi eeza jo hoti hai tum ko<br>
Qareeb hai meri rehlat qafa na ho logo<br>
<br>
Gham e pidar ki na bardaasht laayegi zehra<br>
Nabi ke paas bohat jald jaayegi zehra<br>
____________________________<br>
Gayee makaan ko humsayiou ke aur kahaa<br>
Behal ho saahibo jo kuch huwi hai mujh se khata<br>
Aur ek karti hai tum se ye ilteja Zehra<br>
Mere yateemo pe shafaqat ki tum nazar rakhna<br>
<br>
Jaha me sath ab inka hai aur tumhara hai<br>
Wida saahebo tum sab se hoti Zehra hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Na jaan kar inhe bin maa ka koi jhidkae<br>
Har ek godh me shafaqat se apni bithlaae<br>
Na bachpane me khuda maa ka daagh dikhlaae<br>
Wahi ye dard samajhta hai jo ye gham paae<br>
<br>
Sagheer sin me bada hota hai alam maa ka<br>
Dilou ko karta hai nazuk kamaal gham maa ka<br>
____________________________<br>
Jab aayi bait e sharaf me rasool ki jaayi<br>
Pisar jo saamne aaye na dil ko taab aayi<br>
Jo dhoke rakhhi thi poshaak inko pehnaayi<br>
Bithaa ke godh me har ek ki zulf suljhaayi<br>
<br>
Gale laga liya muh aansu'ou se dhone lagi<br>
Qayaal aaya bidaayi ka jab to rone lagi<br>
____________________________<br>
Ali se kehne lagi phir baha ke ashke batool<br>
Chale jaha'n se ab hum to aye wasiye rasool<br>
Hawaale aapke hai ye mere chaman ke phool<br>
Malool hoyegi zehra jo hoyenge ye malool<br>
<br>
Alam me mere na inko bhulaaiyo saaheb<br>
Hamesha seene pa apne sulaaiyo saheb<br>
____________________________<br>
Kabhi jo roye meri yaad me na jhidkaana<br>
Bitha ke pyar se godhi me apni samjhana<br>
Mere mazaar pe fursat ho gar to le aana<br>
Tum apne hath se inko khilaaiyo khana<br>
<br>
Hai aap jaante haajat nahi hai kehne ki<br>
Hussain ko nahi aadat hai bhooke rehne ki<br>
____________________________<br>
Haram me peetne rone ka ghul huwa barpa<br>
Ali ne fatima ko ghusl deke kafnaaya<br>
Janaza leke chale ghar se jab shahe waala<br>
Haram pukaare khuda hafiz aye aseer e bala<br>
<br>
Na aaya sabr chali haye fatima zehra<br>
Basaane qabr chali haye fatima zehra<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye haal zainabo kulsum ka nazar aaya<br>
Jaha'n pe Fatima Zehra ka tha rakha laasha<br>
Wahan pe lot'ti hai sar khule ba dardo buka<br>
Bayaa'n hai kya huwi ae amma jaa'n hum se khafa<br>
<br>
Bahaane ashk humain soone ghar me chhod gayi<br>
Qusoor kya huwa hum se jo muh ko modh gayi<br>
____________________________<br>
Jo dekha baap ko aate huwe ba chashme tar<br>
Qadam pe gir ke pukaare ke kya huwi maadar<br>
Hamaari hoyegi kis tarha soone ghar me basar<br>
Kaha pe chod ke amma ko aaye bolo pidar<br>
<br>
Basaaya qabr ko veeran ye makaan kiya<br>
Hamare rone ka amma ne kuch na dhyaan kiya<br>
____________________________<br>
Laga ke betou ko seene se ali ne kaha<br>
Batool dekhti ho haal apne bachou ka<br>
Tumhi yateemo ko apne manao aake zara<br>
Na mujh se sambhlenge bache tumhare aye zehra<br>
<br>
Ab aake seene se apne lagalo bachou ko<br>
Kaha ho fatima zehra sambhalo bachou ko<br>
____________________________<br>
Tumhara hujra e qaali mujhe rulaata hai<br>
Qayaal aake tumhara bohat sataata hai<br>
Tumhare bachou ka kehna ghazab ye dhaata hai<br>
Kaha'n hai maa ko bula deeje houl aata hai<br>
<br>
Tumhari tarha se kis tarha naaz uthaau mai<br>
Kaho yateemou ko kya keh ke ab manaau mai<br>
